0label%3A%22BICAN%22)[Mouse Brain](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Mouse%20Brain%22)[Priority-High](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Priority-High%22)[Stale](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Stale%22)\n\nMilestone\n\n[\n\nMilestone 08/12/25\n\n](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/milestone/26)\n\n[![@dosumis](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112839?v=4&size=80)](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\n## Description\n\n[![@dosumis](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112839?v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\n[dosumis](https://github.com/dosumis)\n\nopened [on Apr 29, 2025](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3091#issue-3028391414)\n\nIssue body actions\n\nNeurons in single cell data from brain are commonly claimed to be CGE or LGE derived. We have classes for these already, but it would be good to have some record of common markers used + some testing against datasets. Descriptions could also be fleshed out a bit.\n\nSee [https://www.perplexity.ai/search/what-markers-indicate-origin-o-AjKUvjMqQVOBOKMZm9hoRg](https://www.perplexity.ai/search/what-markers-indicate-origin-o-AjKUvjMqQVOBOKMZm9hoRg)\n\nReactions are currently unavailable\n\n## Metadata\n\n## Metadata\n\n### Assignees\n\n-   [![@RiveraAndrea83](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205639972?s=64&v=4)\n    \n    RiveraAndrea83\n    \n    ](/RiveraAndrea83)\n\n### Labels\n\n[BICAN](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22BICAN%22)[Mouse Brain](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Mouse%20Brain%22)[Priority-High](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Priority-High%22)[Stale](https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Stale%22)\n\n### Type\n\nNo type\n\n### Proj